("api/menu-item" :names ("menu-item") :kind :class :kind-name "Class" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Create and append a normal/check/separator item. Normal/check IDs are positive signed32 and unique across the bar. Separators require NIL ID and empty label/help. Check state is only valid for :CHECK. Help is construction-only. Concrete subclass initargs and DEFAULT-INITARGS are supported; native properties exist in subclass AFTER hooks. Failed initialization cleans newly allocated resources and descendants; it does not undo arbitrary external mutations. Explicit :ENABLED-P or :CHECKED-P on a separator rejects even NIL. A normal item permits NIL checked state but rejects a non-NIL initial check." :position 196943)
